      "sourceId": "0064:000128",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000129",
      "line": 129,
      "sourceId": "0064:000129",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　捕まれた部分を、忍はじっと見た。",
      "english": "Shinobu stared at the place where she'd grabbed him.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000134",
      "line": 134,
      "sourceId": "0064:000134",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「知ってる、知ってるよ！」",
      "english": "“I know! I know what to do!”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000135",
      "line": 135,
      "sourceId": "0064:000135",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「え？」",
      "english": "“What?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000137",
      "line": 137,
      "sourceId": "0064:000137",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「友達、の作り方、知ってる……思いついた」",
      "english": "“I know how to make friends... I just thought of it.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000138",
      "line": 138,
      "sourceId": "0064:000138",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　ためらいがちに。",
      "english": "She spoke hesitantly.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000139",
      "line": 139,
      "sourceId": "0064:000139",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「教えて、くれる？」",
      "english": "“Will you tell me?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000144",
      "line": 144,
      "sourceId": "0064:000144",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　あずさは頷く。\n　顔色を傾けて隠したまま、",
      "english": "Azusa nodded. Her face still turned aside and hidden,",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000145",
      "line": 145,
      "sourceId": "0064:000145",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「あたしたちが、友達になれば、いいと思うよ」",
      "english": "“I think we should be friends.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000146",
      "line": 146,
      "sourceId": "0064:000146",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　却下の対象たりえた。",
      "english": "It was a proposal he could reject.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000147",
      "line": 147,
      "sourceId": "0064:000147",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　忍に必要なのは、対象との接触手段である。\n　対象とあずさは無関係。\n　あずさに頼る意味はない。",
      "english": "What Shinobu needed was a means of contacting his targets. The targets and Azusa were unconnected. There was no reason to rely on her.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000148",
      "line": 148,
      "sourceId": "0064:000148",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　断りの言葉を形作ろうとして、しかし思考を重ねる。",
      "english": "He began to frame a refusal, then thought further.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000149",
      "line": 149,
      "sourceId": "0064:000149",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000157",
      "line": 157,
      "sourceId": "0064:000157",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「だめ……かな？」",
      "english": "“Would that... be bad?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000158",
      "line": 158,
      "sourceId": "0064:000158",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「いや」",
      "english": "“No.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000160",
      "line": 160,
      "sourceId": "0064:000160",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「そうだね……それはいい手だと思うよ」",
      "english": "“You're right... I think that's a good plan.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000162",
      "line": 162,
      "sourceId": "0064:000162",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「……あは……」",
      "english": "“...Ah...”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000163",
      "line": 163,
      "sourceId": "0064:000163",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　忍は狙撃型の監視策を放棄。\n　以降、対象に接近し交友をもって見張る方針へ、\n転換するに至るのである。",
      "english": "Shinobu abandoned the sniper-style approach to surveillance. From then on, he would close in on his targets and monitor them by befriending them.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0064:000164",
      "line": 164,
      "sourceId": "0064:000164",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　あずさをその先兵として―――",
      "english": "With Azusa as the vanguard—",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    }
  ]
}
